  "content": "<p><em><strong>Forge</strong>、<strong>NeoForge</strong>&nbsp;與&nbsp;<strong>Fabric <span style=\"color:#36f\">(</span></strong><span style=\"color:#36f\"><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://throne.me/wallywhip\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://throne.me/wallywhip</a><strong>)</strong></span></em><br><br>是否曾想過能像染羊毛一樣替羊駝染色？<br><br>現在你可以做到了！只需對羊駝右鍵使用染料，牠們就會變換顏色<br><br>你可以修剪牠們的毛，並像綿羊一樣繁殖出各種顏色<br><br>擊殺羊駝時還會掉落羊駝排。美味可口<br><br>觀看<strong>AlexIsModded</strong>的精彩模組展示：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#36f\"><strong><a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5cUpW2uJGCY&amp;t=15s&amp;ab_channel=AlexIsModded\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 1.20 生存模式彩色羊駝模組評測 (第7集) - YouTube</a></strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/498/512/2022-09-23_09.png\" width=\"600\"><br><del><br></del><strong>節慶&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>羊駝</strong></span></strong><del><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/505/929/2022-10-12_16.png\" width=\"600\"><br></del></p>",
